{"v":4,"catch":"踩下它，放下並捏住它！ 是時候做一個漢堡了！","desc":"《Burger Time》是Data East在1982年發行的動作遊戲。\n我們的目標是通過踩踏巨大的食材將漢堡放在下面的盤子上來製作漢堡。\n通過將它們困在漢堡成分之間來擊敗敵人的鹹菜和香腸！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2020-07-30","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/04df503831d05ab775aeb9d630f21fc3678d863bcf26ae0ee5830317c7c7d651.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/71e81f33679d2093977ea7ab86c245b7498b77345897e09bbc5dceb6ffc3e7da.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/86bb04c432743c9b7c69cdb8eb875985c98f6a279aae8c68c58f9864e73973fa.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6eb255c77dc37090f6a2351e843c664da11bd93fe9de381a51fe37b1113d4ad8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/30826ace687c7225c365bf93d7a80e210492d522c3c1e5242d1da0e4fa265d48.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4539880e483f991c2506e793729b847c47208c7763cb44ceccbb42a81ef9086d.jpg"],"titleId":"0100ebb012400000","dlc":[]}